<title>USA: PacifiCorp 550 MW Bridger unit seen up Fri.</title>
<headline>PacifiCorp 550 MW Bridger unit seen up Fri.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unit 3 at the Jim Bridger coal-fired power plant near Rock Springs, Wyo., should be back on line by Friday, sources familiar with the plant's operations said Thursday.</p>
<p>The 550 megawatt (MW) unit tripped off on Saturday due to problems with a fan, and had been expected to restart Thursday.</p>
<p>The Bridger plant's other three 550 MW units are operating at normal rates, the sources said.</p>
<p>--D Beasley, Los Angeles bureau + 1 213 955 6761</p>
</text>
